					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p>Object Used: Standard Class-B Fire Extinguisher</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Observations: The fire extinguisher failed to activate and spray SCP-727-J. Recommendation to use a handler of the fire extinguisher next time.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Object Used: Standard Class-B Fire Extinguisher, D-Class Handler</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Observations: D-5673 failed to activate the fire extinguisher before being incinerated by SCP-727-J. Recommendation for handler to be wearing an air tight suit.</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Object Used: Standard Class-B Fire Extinguisher, D-Class Handler in air-tight suit</p> </blockquote> <blockquote> <p>Observations: Amount of foam generated by the fire extinguisher insufficient to extinguish SCP-727-J. Recommendation to build Jupiter-sized fire extinguisher.</p> </blockquote> <p>Good god, I laughed harder at this than I should have.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
